.TH WEB 1
.SH NAME
web \- open a URL in the browser
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B web
.I url
\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Web
opens each
.I url
in a new tab of the browser that runs the system,
by writing it to
.BR /mnt/browser/open .
Only
.B http
and
.B https
URLs open; a write of another is an error.
.PP
A browser opens a tab only soon after a click or a key in its page.
Later, as when a program runs
.I web
by itself, the page shows a bar with the link to click instead.
.PP
.I Web
is the plumber's start command for URLs in
.BR /sys/lib/plumb/basic ,
so B3 on a URL in
.IR acme (1)
opens it.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /mnt/browser/open
each line written is a URL the page opens;
.B /lib/namespace.plan9web
mounts it from
.B /srv/browser
.SH SOURCE
.B /rc/bin/web
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR plumb (1),
.IR plumber (4)
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
A URL that is not
.B http
or
.B https
gives
.LR "not an http or https url" .
